  "description": "The meme uses the lie detector test as a satirical tool to mock or highlight the absurdity of a situation where a lie is being 'detected'. While not targeting any specific group based on protected characteristics, it may be considered harmful if used to undermine someone's credibility or to spread misinformation by misrepresenting the lie detector test. The meme relies on juxtaposition of serious-sounding 'lie detector test' with comedic tone, which can be interpreted as mocking or ridiculing the subject of the lie.",
